# The named reads frozen in data/first_values.golden: `<key> <IDA address> <length>` (hex).
# A key is the store's registry name, the field path and `/<length>` where a store holds the
# address (`freeze.sh names`), else the Rust item the tests compare (module path, dots).
# Stores of the registry are frozen whole without being listed here.

# math
math.next_random.STATE/4                                0x4E0140 4
race.owner.RACE.shared.work.segment_work_unused[17]/4   0x71C3C8 4
race.owner.RACE.course.numbers.zero/4                   0x5C5D90 4
race.owner.RACE.course.numbers.one/4                    0x5C5D38 4

